WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 3]
[This story is purely fictional]

01:38.020 --> 01:40.420
[Changsha Military Hospital]

01:43.720 --> 01:44.290
Master Zhang,

01:44.560 --> 01:45.210
Wu Laogou is gone.

01:45.840 --> 01:46.570
The men we sent reported

01:46.840 --> 01:47.570
he wasn't at the Wu residence

01:47.710 --> 01:48.690
or anywhere in Changsha City.

01:49.200 --> 01:50.100
Could he have fled?

01:50.840 --> 01:51.260
No.

01:52.150 --> 01:53.260
He'll keep his word.

01:55.000 --> 01:55.410
Where's Tiezui?

01:55.870 --> 01:56.490
Don't worry, Master.

01:56.950 --> 01:57.980
I'll make sure Master Qi comes.

01:58.680 --> 01:59.260
He won't get away.

02:08.710 --> 02:09.820
Wu Laogou is already here.

02:10.240 --> 02:10.730
He is?

02:11.630 --> 02:12.010
Let's go.

02:15.980 --> 02:17.460
[Sealed by the Changsha Defense Headquarters]

02:18.800 --> 02:20.170
[Please Keep Quiet]
Must you spoil yourself like that?

02:20.470 --> 02:21.100
You're such a glutton.

02:21.400 --> 02:22.130
I'm still growing.

02:22.150 --> 02:22.500
Here.

02:24.430 --> 02:24.960
Have this.

02:24.960 --> 02:25.480
Not bad.

02:25.800 --> 02:26.410
It needs more flavor.

02:30.750 --> 02:32.410
Master Zhang, you're certainly in no hurry.

02:32.910 --> 02:34.940
I suppose whoever's missing isn't that important.

02:35.800 --> 02:37.060
Master, look at that opening.

02:38.120 --> 02:39.780
Looks like Laogou came well prepared.

02:41.190 --> 02:42.220
This place is heavily guarded.

02:42.960 --> 02:44.450
You really are resourceful, Fifth Master.

02:45.000 --> 02:45.850
Of course.

02:46.520 --> 02:49.730
Fifth Master Wu is bound to lead the Mystic Nine one day.

02:53.800 --> 02:56.220
We're about to move. Why lay out a feast?

02:57.680 --> 02:58.660
It's for the dogs.

02:59.280 --> 02:59.660
Want some?

03:01.430 --> 03:02.340
Dogs aren't like people.

03:02.430 --> 03:03.690
They won't work unless they're fed.

03:04.560 --> 03:06.660
Looks like Master Zhang doesn't know the Wu Clan's rules.

03:07.310 --> 03:08.890
Go on. Explain them to him.

03:09.120 --> 03:11.730
The Wu Clan built its fortune on dogs.

03:12.190 --> 03:14.410
Their lives matter as much as ours.

03:15.030 --> 03:18.220
Once we're below, please look after them.

03:18.630 --> 03:19.940
Should anything happen...

03:20.280 --> 03:23.170
Save the dogs before the men.

03:25.680 --> 03:27.540
We're used to sharing a pot of food with our dogs.

03:28.030 --> 03:29.780
We saved some choice cuts for you, Master Zhang.

03:30.310 --> 03:31.660
Will you honor us with a few bites?

03:31.840 --> 03:32.340
Care for some?

03:32.960 --> 03:33.730
- Care for some? - Have some.

03:33.750 --> 03:34.850
- Come on. - Join us.

03:45.960 --> 03:46.410
All right.

03:46.840 --> 03:47.540
Is everyone full?

03:48.560 --> 03:50.610
It seems Master Zhang can't stomach sharing a pot with us.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.290
He thinks our food is filthy.

03:52.520 --> 03:53.170
No need to force yourself.

03:53.870 --> 03:55.070
Let's get this over with.

03:55.240 --> 03:55.780
Then the two of us

03:56.630 --> 03:58.410
can part ways for good.

03:59.470 --> 03:59.820
Fine.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.340
Where is Tiezui?

04:01.800 --> 04:03.010
Our intermediary isn't here.

04:03.470 --> 04:05.050
Did you kill him to silence him

04:05.460 --> 04:06.640
so that you could say whatever you wanted?

04:07.030 --> 04:07.690
Master Zhang!

04:08.870 --> 04:09.340
Master Zhang.

04:10.680 --> 04:11.540
I finally made it.

04:12.630 --> 04:13.300
Laogou,

04:13.680 --> 04:14.660
you're all here too.

04:15.800 --> 04:16.730
Good heavens.

04:17.160 --> 04:17.980
That run nearly killed me.

04:18.310 --> 04:19.220
But Master Zhang, I have to say...

04:19.240 --> 04:19.810
Everyone,

04:20.720 --> 04:21.460
prepare to move.

04:21.920 --> 04:22.410
Yes!

04:26.560 --> 04:26.980
Master Zhang,

04:27.560 --> 04:29.140
the signs point to disaster again.

04:30.000 --> 04:31.460
Could you tell me that you like bad omens

04:31.560 --> 04:33.050
so that I can put my mind at ease?

04:41.240 --> 04:41.900
It's so deep.

04:51.040 --> 04:53.760
Come here, sweetheart.

04:53.760 --> 04:55.920
Where are you going?

04:56.040 --> 04:57.370
Come and get me, Master Qiansui.

04:58.870 --> 04:59.780
Oh, you.

05:01.070 --> 05:01.980
Master Qiansui.

05:11.560 --> 05:13.980
Miss Huo followed Wu Laogou underground.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.290
Good.

05:26.000 --> 05:27.410
Take this letter

05:27.630 --> 05:30.980
to the central government's special envoy to Changsha.

05:31.510 --> 05:32.900
Tell him

05:33.120 --> 05:35.730
if he wants to replace Zhang Qishan,

05:36.040 --> 05:38.930
now is his best chance.

05:39.800 --> 05:40.340
Yes.

05:47.070 --> 05:47.850
Wait.

05:53.390 --> 05:54.660
As usual,

05:55.630 --> 05:57.100
take this letter

05:58.360 --> 06:00.290
to that gentleman.

06:00.720 --> 06:04.180
Tell him the show has begun

06:05.240 --> 06:08.410
and that he'll soon get what he wants.

06:48.120 --> 06:48.660
Master,

06:49.190 --> 06:50.250
you were so quick.

06:50.750 --> 06:51.580
Zhang Qishan and his men

06:51.950 --> 06:52.930
must still be far behind.

06:53.720 --> 06:54.540
Are you blind?

06:54.800 --> 06:55.610
Didn't you see?

06:56.000 --> 06:56.810
They came down before us.

07:00.360 --> 07:00.900
Here. Take it.

07:01.360 --> 07:01.730
Thanks.

07:05.920 --> 07:06.900
You took your time.

07:08.190 --> 07:08.900
I didn't want to draw attention.

07:11.040 --> 07:11.460
Master.

07:18.830 --> 07:20.140
Always spoiling for a fight,

07:20.160 --> 07:20.900
Zhang Qishan?

07:23.360 --> 07:24.370
Why rush down here?

07:26.630 --> 07:27.780
A man shouldn't always try to prove himself.

07:29.440 --> 07:30.370
What are you staring at?

07:31.310 --> 07:32.810
Am I that handsome?

07:33.510 --> 07:34.610
Why do you keep staring at me?

07:37.750 --> 07:39.050
Gentlemen,

07:39.600 --> 07:40.780
let's keep the peace.

07:41.240 --> 07:41.900
Let's keep the peace.

07:42.480 --> 07:43.140
Please.

07:46.750 --> 07:47.700
Where's the mechanism?

07:48.920 --> 07:49.490
Follow me.

07:54.820 --> 07:58.220
[Sealed by the Changsha Defense Headquarters]

08:30.280 --> 08:31.290
The bricks in this wall

08:31.600 --> 08:33.090
were fitted together with mortise-and-tenon joints.

08:34.280 --> 08:35.380
Now that we know

08:35.440 --> 08:36.740
the mechanism is on the other side,

08:37.720 --> 08:38.740
we'll need

08:39.560 --> 08:41.180
a little dog to trigger it.

08:41.830 --> 08:42.700
Fifth Master, please.

08:49.990 --> 08:50.730
Come on, Runty.

08:57.390 --> 08:58.730
You've had your fill. Now get to work.

09:16.720 --> 09:17.220
Thank you, Fifth Master.

09:19.550 --> 09:20.460
Have some more.

09:21.750 --> 09:22.420
You're too skinny.

09:45.720 --> 09:47.250
Runty found the mechanism.

09:56.000 --> 09:57.300
It's triggered by weight.

09:58.720 --> 09:59.490
By weight?

10:18.360 --> 10:19.100
There's another one.

10:20.120 --> 10:20.610
Fifth Master,

10:21.000 --> 10:22.700
why are there so many mechanisms in here?

10:25.750 --> 10:26.180
Dagger.

10:35.870 --> 10:36.530
I see.

10:37.750 --> 10:38.340
How

10:38.960 --> 10:39.820
does it work?

10:40.390 --> 10:41.460
You wouldn't understand.

10:42.320 --> 10:44.420
This is going to be difficult.

10:45.510 --> 10:46.730
Serves you right.

10:48.600 --> 10:50.180
Now we'll see if you trust me, Zhang Qishan.

10:50.910 --> 10:52.770
I want everything you have on you.

10:53.960 --> 10:54.850
What exactly?

10:58.030 --> 10:58.490
Every last bullet.

11:03.240 --> 11:03.820
Fifth Master!

11:05.790 --> 11:06.700
- Fifth Master! - Master Zhang!

11:06.870 --> 11:07.400
No!

11:07.750 --> 11:08.610
Please don't!

11:15.440 --> 11:15.850
Will this do?

12:19.390 --> 12:20.300
Master Zhang,

12:23.150 --> 12:23.530
after you.

12:27.360 --> 12:27.700
Move out.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.220
Dogs have keen noses.

12:37.840 --> 12:39.610
Disturbed earth qi can drive them mad.

12:40.790 --> 12:42.220
Erlang, Sanlang, Xiaotian,

12:43.080 --> 12:44.180
stay here with the dogs

12:44.630 --> 12:45.460
and be ready to support us.

12:45.750 --> 12:46.250
- Yes. - Yes.

12:46.720 --> 12:47.100
Move out.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.460
Why do I hear birds underground?

13:44.750 --> 13:45.300
Runty.

13:46.550 --> 13:46.980
Here.

13:53.120 --> 13:53.580
Master Zhang,

13:54.360 --> 13:55.250
these are all sacrifices.

14:00.960 --> 14:01.460
Tiezui.

14:08.270 --> 14:09.370
No,

14:09.840 --> 14:10.850
these aren't sacrifices.

14:12.030 --> 14:14.180
They're offerings to deities, Master Zhang.

14:15.360 --> 14:16.100
In ancient times,

14:16.750 --> 14:18.490
people worshipped deities here.

14:19.240 --> 14:19.820
There must be

14:21.510 --> 14:23.340
a shrine up ahead.

15:03.840 --> 15:04.370
Xiaoyu.

15:47.720 --> 15:48.340
Find anything?

15:49.240 --> 15:50.530
The air here is stale.

15:51.320 --> 15:52.610
I think I'm seeing things.

15:53.480 --> 15:55.850
The sticky-rice mortar contains powdered oyster shell.

15:57.240 --> 15:59.610
It was a special Ministry of Works formula from the Tongzhi era.

16:00.640 --> 16:02.660
Whoever built this place was no ordinary person.

16:04.240 --> 16:04.660
Look.

16:06.870 --> 16:08.180
This building appears to have three stories,

16:09.200 --> 16:11.010
but the number of upturned eaves doesn't add up.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.460
It seems there's

16:15.870 --> 16:17.180
more space inside than meets the eye.

16:24.750 --> 16:27.060
Isn't that the same trick we use?

16:29.240 --> 16:30.300
You can put him in a uniform,

16:31.600 --> 16:32.490
but a thief's still a thief.

16:32.870 --> 16:34.100
- What did you say?
- Shut your filthy mouth.

16:35.200 --> 16:35.820
Watch your mouth.

16:36.270 --> 16:37.060
Once we're out,

16:37.080 --> 16:38.580
they may arrest you for spreading rumors.

16:38.630 --> 16:39.490
Say that again.

16:39.630 --> 16:40.180
What are you doing?

16:40.200 --> 16:40.940
You think I don't have a gun?

16:41.550 --> 16:42.250
Enough!

16:48.960 --> 16:49.340
Master.

16:52.320 --> 16:52.730
Open it.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.220
All right.

17:00.550 --> 17:01.460
Lower your weapons.

17:01.870 --> 17:02.370
Come on.

17:02.720 --> 17:03.370
Let's go in.

17:05.510 --> 17:06.140
Once we're inside,

17:07.030 --> 17:07.620
stay close to me.

17:58.270 --> 17:58.620
Master,

17:59.880 --> 18:00.770
there's no trace of them.

18:01.240 --> 18:02.380
Search every passage, now.

18:02.880 --> 18:03.180
Yes.

18:03.680 --> 18:03.940
Search.

18:04.160 --> 18:04.810
- Yes. - Yes.

18:12.110 --> 18:13.420
"Rejuvenation"?

18:13.830 --> 18:14.530
What does that mean?

18:25.200 --> 18:26.460
"No Way to Live."

18:29.310 --> 18:31.050
Master, this door is sealed shut.

18:31.480 --> 18:32.860
"No Way to Die."

18:33.880 --> 18:34.660
This one is sealed too.

18:36.880 --> 18:38.250
Every door here has a name.

18:42.720 --> 18:43.980
These reliefs

18:44.160 --> 18:44.620
depict someone

18:44.720 --> 18:46.010
returning from the dead.

18:46.310 --> 18:47.530
Returning from the dead?

18:48.640 --> 18:49.140
Eighth Master.

18:50.110 --> 18:50.860
Look at this one.

18:51.440 --> 18:53.730
Doesn't it show day and night reversed?

18:54.070 --> 18:54.620
Yes.

18:55.830 --> 18:57.330
Every scene on these reliefs

18:58.240 --> 18:59.900
has to do with shifts in time.

19:01.000 --> 19:01.900
Then why

19:02.550 --> 19:03.700
did they add the words?

19:04.000 --> 19:05.380
The craftsmen weren't skilled enough.

19:06.590 --> 19:08.220
To make sure visitors understood,

19:08.510 --> 19:09.860
they simply added the words.

19:10.750 --> 19:11.730
Was whoever built this place

19:12.480 --> 19:13.700
poorly educated?

19:15.830 --> 19:17.290
Well, at least they were literate.

19:45.460 --> 19:47.460
[Otherworld Tower]

19:51.720 --> 19:53.090
So that's what it says.

19:55.510 --> 19:56.180
Laogou,

19:56.590 --> 19:57.770
I thought you couldn't read.

19:59.030 --> 19:59.660
That's right.

20:02.400 --> 20:02.940
Fifth Master,

20:03.510 --> 20:05.140
what does it say?

20:11.270 --> 20:12.180
Otherworld Tower...

20:13.070 --> 20:13.810
Otherworld Tower.

20:17.440 --> 20:18.180
Could this place

20:19.510 --> 20:21.570
be linked to the Otherworld Patriarch?

20:24.000 --> 20:24.940
The Otherworld Patriarch?

20:27.310 --> 20:28.380
Who's that supposed to be?

20:29.640 --> 20:30.980
He's a figure from an old folk legend.

20:31.640 --> 20:33.770
My grandfather told me about him when I was a boy.

20:34.200 --> 20:35.620
A hundred years ago, in Changsha,

20:36.070 --> 20:37.290
there lived a remarkable man

20:37.590 --> 20:38.730
known as the Otherworld Patriarch.

20:42.830 --> 20:44.010
"Karma will uncover itself.

20:45.110 --> 20:46.330
The Patriarch awaits you."

20:47.510 --> 20:48.220
Legend says

20:48.790 --> 20:50.180
he could turn back time

20:50.480 --> 20:51.490
and rewrite fate.

20:52.550 --> 20:55.290
The emperor wanted him under his control,

20:55.960 --> 20:57.700
so he sent 100,000 troops

20:57.700 --> 20:58.440
[Changsha City]

20:58.440 --> 20:59.860
to surround Changsha City.

21:00.510 --> 21:01.570
But little did he know

21:02.160 --> 21:03.330
the Otherworld Patriarch's spells

21:03.640 --> 21:05.490
had all taken effect before they reached

21:05.720 --> 21:07.050
the city gates of Changsha City.

21:07.400 --> 21:09.140
Every face in Changsha City

21:09.270 --> 21:10.570
was blurred beyond recognition.

21:10.960 --> 21:13.730
The emperor couldn't tell which man was the Otherworld Patriarch.

21:14.510 --> 21:15.530
Most terrifying of all,

21:15.790 --> 21:16.730
that very night,

21:17.070 --> 21:18.940
even the emperor's own face had blurred.

21:18.960 --> 21:19.330
Tiezui.

21:20.790 --> 21:21.490
Tell us as we walk.

21:26.350 --> 21:28.250
So I'm not the only one who finds you annoying.

21:29.320 --> 21:30.480
Xiaoyu, blow the door open.

21:30.480 --> 21:30.880
Yes.

22:00.310 --> 22:03.420
To escape the troops, the Otherworld Patriarch cast a spell

22:03.960 --> 22:04.700
and led his followers

22:04.720 --> 22:06.980
to an immortal realm called Xumi Realm.

22:08.110 --> 22:09.980
There, they built a hidden paradise

22:10.310 --> 22:11.860
filled with countless treasures.

22:12.750 --> 22:13.250
This tower

22:13.750 --> 22:16.050
may be the entrance to Xumi Realm.

22:17.440 --> 22:20.490
Was Unit 401 trying to reach it too?

23:21.270 --> 23:22.250
This belongs to Unit 401.

23:45.310 --> 23:45.770
Found them.

23:46.270 --> 23:47.050
Runty says

23:47.350 --> 23:49.380
Unit 401 is less than 800 meters ahead,

23:51.590 --> 23:53.220
and they're still moving forward.

23:59.310 --> 23:59.940
Boys,

24:00.440 --> 24:01.570
get those legs moving.

24:02.240 --> 24:03.140
Once we catch them,

24:03.510 --> 24:05.490
someone will have to leave the Mystic Nine.

24:06.440 --> 24:07.180
Let's make sure

24:07.750 --> 24:08.660
we don't waste

24:08.680 --> 24:09.940
this once-in-a-lifetime chance.

24:12.240 --> 24:12.800
Go.

24:18.720 --> 24:19.180
Move!

24:22.240 --> 24:23.330
Are you leaving me behind?

24:23.720 --> 24:24.570
Wait for me!

24:54.880 --> 24:56.050
All this chasing, and still nothing.

24:56.750 --> 24:58.290
Unit 401 has medical staff and patients.

24:58.640 --> 24:59.620
They couldn't be moving that fast.

25:05.790 --> 25:06.660
Runty says

25:08.350 --> 25:09.570
they're still 800 meters ahead.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.620
Still 800 meters?

25:12.650 --> 25:13.470
How is that possible?

25:14.000 --> 25:15.210
Did your dog pick up the wrong scent?

25:16.750 --> 25:17.810
Then you sniff them out,

25:18.000 --> 25:18.730
Puppy Zhang.

25:19.030 --> 25:19.380
You...!

25:19.440 --> 25:20.530
Drop any equipment you don't need

25:21.160 --> 25:21.860
to lighten your load.

25:22.030 --> 25:23.220
Get ready to continue the chase.

25:24.960 --> 25:25.490
Yes.

25:30.560 --> 25:30.970
Come on.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.250
Master Zhang!

25:47.920 --> 25:49.380
You left me behind, Master!

25:49.830 --> 25:51.490
None of you waited for me, Master!

25:52.050 --> 25:52.640
All right.

25:52.640 --> 25:53.900
I nearly got lost.

25:55.400 --> 25:56.250
That run nearly killed me.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.620
I did a reading before I left.

25:58.920 --> 26:00.900
It said we mustn't split up.

26:01.350 --> 26:02.460
Things will go wrong if we do.

26:02.510 --> 26:04.730
If we had to split up, which group would you join?

26:10.110 --> 26:10.620
Master,

26:11.310 --> 26:12.620
I'd follow you, of course.

26:13.200 --> 26:14.330
The signs were clear:

26:14.640 --> 26:16.620
The two of us must stay together.

26:17.160 --> 26:18.380
I wasn't planning to split up.

26:19.110 --> 26:20.730
I'm warning you now, just in case.

26:20.750 --> 26:21.380
Ready?

26:25.640 --> 26:26.250
Again?

26:27.440 --> 26:28.250
Gentlemen,

26:28.590 --> 26:29.400
is this really necessary?

26:29.510 --> 26:30.550
What about me?

26:30.640 --> 26:30.940
You...

27:06.440 --> 27:06.980
Xiaoyu,

27:07.110 --> 27:07.940
slow down!

27:55.000 --> 27:55.620
Slow down!

27:56.240 --> 27:57.010
Slow down, please!

27:57.550 --> 27:58.330
Good heavens.

27:59.240 --> 28:00.050
Master Zhang,

28:00.640 --> 28:01.980
could you calm down?

28:03.350 --> 28:04.380
I'm just a wandering fortune-teller.

28:05.000 --> 28:05.980
Are you trying to kill me?

28:16.720 --> 28:17.250
Well?

28:18.880 --> 28:19.940
Still 800 meters ahead.

28:20.640 --> 28:21.660
We have to keep chasing?

28:21.680 --> 28:22.380
Still 800 meters?

28:22.790 --> 28:23.330
Gentlemen,

28:23.550 --> 28:25.180
why don't we head back?

28:30.350 --> 28:30.900
- Master Zhang... - Keep moving!

28:31.110 --> 28:31.530
Master Zhang...

28:33.350 --> 28:33.810
Fifth Master!

28:35.920 --> 28:36.700
Xiaoyu...

28:42.000 --> 28:43.050
Put me down!

28:43.310 --> 28:44.190
The men behind can't keep up.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.810
Tell them to follow our tracks.

28:46.750 --> 28:47.810
Actually, we could...

28:49.440 --> 28:50.180
Pick up the pace.

28:52.440 --> 28:53.380
Slow down.

29:18.070 --> 29:20.050
Mark the way down

29:20.110 --> 29:22.090
with morning glories

29:23.000 --> 29:25.570
so I can follow later.

30:05.590 --> 30:06.330
What is it?

30:08.070 --> 30:09.050
We still haven't found them.

30:09.750 --> 30:11.490
Your dog barked just now.

30:15.200 --> 30:15.900
It said...

30:17.000 --> 30:17.380
It said...

30:22.590 --> 30:23.180
Are you all right?

30:26.270 --> 30:26.730
I'm fine.

30:28.750 --> 30:29.290
It said

30:30.160 --> 30:31.380
they were still 800 meters ahead.

30:34.350 --> 30:36.050
They can't be faster than me.

30:36.640 --> 30:37.530
How are they still 800 meters away?

30:38.640 --> 30:39.570
Master Zhang!

30:40.510 --> 30:41.330
Master Zhang...

30:42.830 --> 30:43.380
Master Zhang...

30:53.400 --> 30:54.570
You didn't even run. Why are you retching?

30:55.640 --> 30:56.620
I didn't run,

30:57.110 --> 30:58.330
but all that bouncing...

31:03.160 --> 31:03.980
Master Zhang,

31:04.480 --> 31:06.250
if even you can't catch them,

31:06.920 --> 31:08.530
we should stop wasting our strength.

31:20.240 --> 31:21.090
Good grief.

31:23.000 --> 31:23.770
Still 800 meters!

31:24.350 --> 31:25.140
What do you mean?

31:25.400 --> 31:26.730
We've been standing here this whole time,

31:27.440 --> 31:28.700
yet they haven't moved at all.

31:34.480 --> 31:36.250
It's as if they're waiting for us.

31:37.440 --> 31:38.140
When we move,

31:38.510 --> 31:39.180
they move.

31:40.070 --> 31:40.810
When we stop,

31:41.440 --> 31:42.090
they stop.

31:43.790 --> 31:44.940
It's as if they're deliberately

31:44.960 --> 31:46.250
keeping 800 meters between us.

31:46.590 --> 31:47.490
How is that possible?

31:48.350 --> 31:49.840
Even the finest soldiers

31:49.920 --> 31:51.180
couldn't match Master Zhang's speed.

31:51.750 --> 31:53.090
And they've got medics and patients with them.

31:53.590 --> 31:54.380
It's impossible.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.700
Unless

31:59.590 --> 32:03.220
the Otherworld Patriarch really can control time.

32:08.310 --> 32:10.660
Master Zhang, didn't I tell you?

32:10.830 --> 32:12.940
This must have something to do with the Otherworld Patriarch.

32:32.510 --> 32:33.660
We can't catch them.

32:34.030 --> 32:34.700
That's a fact.

32:35.270 --> 32:36.700
And their position hasn't changed.

32:37.240 --> 32:38.180
Then we stay put.

32:38.440 --> 32:39.330
Only the dog goes after them.

32:43.310 --> 32:44.380
Can your dog still run?

32:47.000 --> 32:47.490
Runty,

32:48.070 --> 32:48.530
come here.

32:49.070 --> 32:49.570
Look at me.

32:50.680 --> 32:51.290
Listen.

32:51.640 --> 32:52.700
Whatever happens,

32:53.640 --> 32:54.570
stay alive.

32:55.720 --> 32:56.860
Nothing else matters.

33:00.240 --> 33:00.570
Go.

33:17.310 --> 33:17.940
What happened?

33:18.200 --> 33:18.980
Why did you fall so far behind?

33:37.440 --> 33:37.860
Runty.

33:39.200 --> 33:39.700
Runty.

33:40.790 --> 33:41.290
Runty?

33:52.380 --> 33:54.460
[Zhang Guiwei]

33:56.200 --> 33:57.420
This belongs to Unit 401.

34:00.270 --> 34:01.770
Why is there blood on it?

34:03.200 --> 34:04.730
What happened to your unit?

34:06.750 --> 34:07.620
We'll know

34:08.800 --> 34:09.690
when we find them.

34:10.280 --> 34:11.340
That's obvious.

34:11.960 --> 34:12.820
But how are we supposed to find them?

34:13.320 --> 34:13.900
They keep

34:13.920 --> 34:14.980
800 meters ahead of us.

34:15.440 --> 34:17.010
Eight hundred meters? Still?

34:17.510 --> 34:18.980
When the dog approaches, they stay put.

34:19.440 --> 34:20.860
But when we advance, so do they.

34:21.960 --> 34:23.460
They're toying with us.

34:25.590 --> 34:26.820
If they insist

34:26.840 --> 34:28.010
on keeping their distance,

34:29.440 --> 34:31.050
what if we back away?

34:32.070 --> 34:32.740
You mean

34:34.840 --> 34:35.820
they'll come back?

34:36.400 --> 34:37.000
If they truly

34:37.000 --> 34:38.490
want to maintain that distance,

34:39.000 --> 34:39.820
they'll have to.

34:40.030 --> 34:41.050
But even if they come back,

34:41.440 --> 34:42.420
they'll still be 800 meters away.

34:45.320 --> 34:46.300
Let me make this clear.

34:46.550 --> 34:47.650
My dog is terrified.

34:48.230 --> 34:49.050
It can't run anymore.

34:49.480 --> 34:50.570
Your dog can rest.

34:53.360 --> 34:54.780
If they do move backward,

34:55.590 --> 34:56.610
I'll have a way.

35:12.630 --> 35:13.860
If we all leave,

35:14.480 --> 35:15.690
how will we know

35:15.710 --> 35:16.380
if they've come back?

35:17.110 --> 35:18.260
This trap we set

35:18.630 --> 35:20.570
has a thread tied between the flame sticks.

35:21.960 --> 35:22.940
If they come back

35:23.110 --> 35:24.010
and tug the thread,

35:24.670 --> 35:26.050
the flame sticks will fall and go out.

35:37.150 --> 35:37.570
Master,

35:38.110 --> 35:38.980
everything's ready.

36:18.880 --> 36:20.340
Why is the mural changing?

36:20.760 --> 36:23.170
It shows different images from different angles.

36:35.510 --> 36:38.050
From the front, it welcomes guests.

36:44.110 --> 36:46.570
From behind, demons come for your life.

36:48.190 --> 36:48.780
Master Zhang,

36:49.230 --> 36:50.740
the mural is warning us

36:51.030 --> 36:52.490
not to turn back.

36:54.510 --> 36:56.010
The mural has its warning.

36:56.760 --> 36:57.820
I have my reasons.

36:58.480 --> 36:59.530
If we don't turn back,

36:59.960 --> 37:01.650
Unit 401 won't come back.

37:02.480 --> 37:03.340
Keep backing away.

37:22.150 --> 37:24.340
Master, we've backed up nearly 800 meters.

38:00.230 --> 38:01.380
They really are coming back.

38:05.320 --> 38:07.610
Zhang Qishan, what if one person stays put

38:08.590 --> 38:09.820
while everyone else

38:10.880 --> 38:11.570
backs away?

38:12.760 --> 38:13.420
Let's find out.

38:14.900 --> 38:15.460
Back up.

38:55.480 --> 38:56.300
I see.

38:57.440 --> 38:58.570
They keep 800 meters

38:59.070 --> 39:00.490
from whoever is farthest ahead.

39:04.550 --> 39:06.090
You're not planning to lead them

39:06.280 --> 39:07.530
straight out of this building, are you?

39:07.840 --> 39:08.940
That'd be quite a foolish plan.

39:09.590 --> 39:10.260
Of course not.

39:11.280 --> 39:12.010
Then what are you planning?

39:12.590 --> 39:13.340
Do you remember

39:13.710 --> 39:14.650
that on our way here,

39:14.760 --> 39:15.940
we passed through a corridor

39:16.030 --> 39:17.530
with upper and lower levels?

39:20.630 --> 39:21.900
If they always stay

39:21.920 --> 39:23.130
800 meters away from us,

39:23.880 --> 39:25.690
then when we return to the upper corridor,

39:26.030 --> 39:27.340
Unit 401 will still be below,

39:27.960 --> 39:29.260
matching our movements

39:29.480 --> 39:30.460
as they retreat toward the stairs.

39:31.030 --> 39:31.610
That means

39:32.440 --> 39:33.860
when both sides pass

39:33.880 --> 39:35.570
through that overlapping section,

39:36.190 --> 39:38.010
there'll be a brief moment

39:41.710 --> 39:42.780
when they're

39:43.150 --> 39:44.450
directly beneath us.

39:46.030 --> 39:46.620
So,

39:47.440 --> 39:49.000
once we hear their footsteps,

39:49.760 --> 39:50.900
we can adjust our position

39:51.440 --> 39:52.150
and blast

39:52.630 --> 39:53.490
a hole through the floor.

39:54.320 --> 39:56.610
Then we can drop straight into their ranks.

39:58.630 --> 39:59.210
Master Zhang,

39:59.840 --> 40:00.940
we've backed up nearly 800 meters.

40:06.880 --> 40:08.980
Why can't we hear anything?

40:10.150 --> 40:11.380
Didn't they come back?

40:11.960 --> 40:13.260
Let's take five more steps back.

40:26.510 --> 40:26.980
Xiaoyu.

40:33.150 --> 40:33.490
Blow it!

41:00.590 --> 41:02.010
Unit 401.

41:06.150 --> 41:08.010
Unit 401!

41:12.230 --> 41:14.980
Is that really Unit 401 ahead of Master Zhang?

41:15.880 --> 41:16.650
It looks

41:18.070 --> 41:18.570
like them.

41:19.400 --> 41:19.980
But

41:21.400 --> 41:23.480
why are they acting so strangely?

41:24.320 --> 41:24.860
Unit 401,

41:25.440 --> 41:26.130
attention.

41:26.630 --> 41:27.780
About-face!

41:52.280 --> 41:52.820
Tiezui.

41:53.880 --> 41:56.780
Who walks with their head bowed the whole time?

41:57.070 --> 41:59.340
The living look up. The dead bow their heads.

42:01.710 --> 42:02.380
Could everyone

42:03.800 --> 42:05.340
in Unit 401 be dead?

42:31.440 --> 42:32.210
Good heavens...

42:36.850 --> 42:37.220
They...

42:37.400 --> 42:37.740
They...

42:37.740 --> 42:38.530
They turned around.

42:38.760 --> 42:39.940
Zhang Qishan wants us

42:40.000 --> 42:41.340
to get a look at their faces.

42:43.110 --> 42:44.010
Everyone, keep quiet.

42:47.150 --> 42:47.900
Zhang Qishan,

42:49.110 --> 42:50.050
they've turned around.

42:51.280 --> 42:52.210
Keep walking.

43:24.150 --> 43:24.600
What...

43:24.630 --> 43:25.210
Master!

43:26.850 --> 43:27.210
Don't move.

44:07.780 --> 44:11.940
♪The past fades like smoke♪

44:12.300 --> 44:15.020
♪A choice is made in silence♪

44:15.300 --> 44:18.100
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

44:18.500 --> 44:22.260
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

44:22.500 --> 44:25.940
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

44:26.220 --> 44:29.620
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

44:29.700 --> 44:36.980
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

44:37.420 --> 44:40.700
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

44:40.980 --> 44:44.220
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

44:44.380 --> 44:48.420
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

44:48.620 --> 44:51.980
♪Who believes in fate?♪

44:52.220 --> 44:55.580
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

44:55.820 --> 44:59.100
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

44:59.420 --> 45:03.100
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

45:03.300 --> 45:06.540
♪Take care♪

45:06.540 --> 45:09.100
♪We once raced♪

45:09.180 --> 45:11.100
♪For the dawn♪

45:11.260 --> 45:14.540
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

45:14.660 --> 45:17.940
♪In the web of fate♪

45:17.940 --> 45:21.140
♪No one can escape♪

45:22.140 --> 45:23.980
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

45:24.140 --> 45:25.700
♪We too were young once♪

45:25.780 --> 45:29.220
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

45:29.420 --> 45:31.740
♪Keep the ember lit♪

45:31.860 --> 45:36.380
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

45:36.500 --> 45:39.460
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

45:39.700 --> 45:43.220
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

45:43.340 --> 45:47.100
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

45:47.420 --> 45:50.900
♪Who believes in fate?♪

45:51.060 --> 45:54.060
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

45:54.300 --> 45:58.060
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

45:58.220 --> 46:01.940
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

46:02.060 --> 46:13.500
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
